// Bandit Level 7 → Level 8

URL: https://overthewire.org/wargames/bandit/

Step1: Log in to the Bandit Level 7 server using SSH:

        ssh bandit7@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220

Step2: Enter the password obtained from Bandit Level 6.

Step3: List the files in the current directory:

        ls

Step4: A file named `data.txt` is present.

Step5: We need to find the line containing the word `millionth`.

Step6: Use the `grep` command to search for `millionth`:

        grep "millionth" data.txt

Step7: The output contains the password required to log in to the next level, `bandit8`.

Step8: Use the obtained password to connect to the next level:

        ssh bandit8@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220

Step9: The Bandit Level 7 → Level 8 challenge is solved.

Step10: Congratulations!! you have solved this problem!!
